# R1 test: SET_SKEW_FACTORS rejects a non-finite factor.
#
# `gcmd.get_float()` parses with `float()`, so "nan" and "inf" reach the
# command without complaint even though a NaN factor silently poisons every
# later transform (the position becomes NaN and the printer is unusable
# until a restart).  The command must refuse them instead.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG skew_correction_factors.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
SET_SKEW_FACTORS XY=nan
